 "description": "BIGVILLE R14 (block 262000) -- HEALTH is ONE variable, two timescales (aging = illness). bl_age (CHRONIC decline, tags last_cause=1) + bl_acute (ACUTE drop -- illness/injury/starvation/exhaustion, illness_cause tags the route 2/3/4, RECOVERABLE) both reduce the SAME health on a LifeState node; bl_recover (care/rest/doctor) restores it up to max_health; bl_death is the UNIFYING decision -- health<=0 -> dead, death_cause = the route (age/illness/starvation/exhaustion). Aging and illness are the SAME rule shape (a health delta). NO reward/punishment token (illness/death are STATES). Composes existing DSL Terms; ZERO new Rust.",
